WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
LYNX runs VST3 and CLAP plugins. Options, Plugin manager lists them.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.400
Plugin folders shows where LYNX looks: the standard folders, and any you add.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:20.400
Find new plugins checks each file in a separate process, so a bad one can't crash LYNX.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.000
Here: free plugins such as Dragonfly Reverb and the LSP collection.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.600
To use one, select a Mixer track and click an empty slot...

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.600
...Plugin, More plugins, and find it by name.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Add opens the plugin's own window.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:49.000
Press Play: the chords now ring in the hall reverb.
